### 1. ABOUT SOFTWARELABS

SoftwareLabs is a personal software engineering brand, development initiative, and technology ecosystem founded and led by **Paras Dhiman (GitHub: @Paras367)**, who serves as its Chairman.

SoftwareLabs operates as the central identity under which its software projects, digital products, developer tools, engineering resources, designs, websites, documentation, and associated initiatives are developed, maintained, and presented.

All official SoftwareLabs projects and properties are governed by their applicable ownership rights and licensing terms.

